  // gemini-embedding-001 reads at most 2,048 tokens of each text and drops the rest without an error. Measured on the r6 RP with
  // the Gemma 3 tokenizer (Gemini's): Korean RP text runs 1.33-1.62 characters per token, so 2,000 characters stay under the limit
  // even at one character per token. A longer text is split at the last line break or '. ' in the second half of the window, and the piece vectors are averaged by length.
  const SEMANTIC_CHUNK_CHARS = 2000;
